Vector peak: fp8, 12 independent chains, 4096 iterations, 64 lanes/register
Arithmetic: the vector ISA has no FP8 arithmetic instruction, only FP8 conversion and movement, so each update converts FP8->FP32, issues a native FP32 FMA and converts back, keeping FP8 state; the conversions are overhead and are not counted, so this is a pipeline rate with FP8 operands, not a native FP8 vector peak
